    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new type of puzzle 2D platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send the duck to its nest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the block spirits. They can transform into blocks while holding down the materialize button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The duck will keep moving straight, but will change direction if it hits a wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716200/extras/5b5809c0e03179d8a4f070ba97c7572c.poster.avif?t=1752073299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716200/extras/5b5809c0e03179d8a4f070ba97c7572c.webm?t=1752073299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716200/extras/5b5809c0e03179d8a4f070ba97c7572c.mp4?t=1752073299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create platforms and walls in the right places to guide the duck to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When and where will you materialize the blocks? Your brain will be put to the test.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new type of puzzle 2D platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send the duck to its nest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the block spirits. They can transform into blocks while holding down the materialize button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The duck will keep moving straight, but will change direction if it hits a wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716200/extras/5b5809c0e03179d8a4f070ba97c7572c.poster.avif?t=1752073299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716200/extras/5b5809c0e03179d8a4f070ba97c7572c.webm?t=1752073299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716200/extras/5b5809c0e03179d8a4f070ba97c7572c.mp4?t=1752073299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create platforms and walls in the right places to guide the duck to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When and where will you materialize the blocks? Your brain will be put to the test.</p>",
